.SH NAME
QDataSink \- A QDataSink is an asynchronous consumer of data
\fBClasses\fR - Annotated - Tree - Functions - Home - \fBStructure\fR </div>
.br
.SH SYNOPSIS
.br
.PP
\fC#include <qasyncio.h>\fR
.PP
Inherits QAsyncIO.
.PP
.SS "Public Members"
.in +1c
